%% status: current (solid = implemented, dashed = proposed)
%% title: Approval and authorization, distinct authorities
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Authenticated user
  participant R as Registry on server
  participant W as Freighter wallet
  participant K as Clearing contract
  U->>R: sign in with email or a verified wallet challenge
  Note over R: Authentication grants no role
  R->>R: check membership, role and reviewer grant
  U->>R: reviewer decision on one calculation
  Note over R: Separation of duties, not the user who ran or changed the inputs
  R-->>U: approval stored and bound to that calculation
  Note over R: An application approval is a database record, not a signature
  U->>W: approve_settlement for the current digest (owner-run tools, local)
  W-->>K: signed approval
  K->>K: every admitted participant must approve the current digest
  Note over K: Each debtor separately authorizes settle with session, digest and its own total
